<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="800000"><br>はい！お疲れ様でした。<br>其の②です。<br><br>⑦Rune of Astral<br>  3個<br><br>⑧Rune of Ap'Sagor<br>　1個<br><br>⑨Diamond<br>　1個<br><br>⑩Lvory lmbued Collar<br>  MAGIC LORE ITEM<br>  Slot: NECK<br>  AC: 8  <br>  WIS: +5  MANA: +10  SVF: +2  SVD: +10<br>  SHM only<br><br>⑪Sarnak Battle Shield<br>  MAGIC LORE ITEM<br>  Slot: SECONDARY<br>  AC: 25<br>  STR: +5  HP: +40  SVF: +10  SVC: +10  SVM: +10<br>  Class: WAR CLR PAL SHD DRU BRD SHM<br>  Race: ALL<br><br>⑫Argent Defender<br>  MAGIC ITEM<br>  Slot: PRIMARY<br>  2HS   Delay: 49  DMG: 33<br>  MANA: +20<br>  Class: WAR PAL RNG SHD<br>　Race: ALL<br><br>⑬Burnished Wooden Stave<br>  MAGIC ITEM<br>  Slot: PRIMARY<br>  2HB  Delay: 45  Dmg: 15<br>  Class: WAR CLR SHD DRU MNK SHM NEC WIZ MAG ENC BST<br>  Race: ALL <br><br>  ９/１０の日付有効で願います。<br>  200 で振って下さい。下も200 でお願いします。<br><br></font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
<font color=#000000>Buchi：32</font><br>
</font></td></tr></table>
<P><hr width=95% size=1>
<div align=center>
<table border=0 width=99% cellspacing=1 cellpadding=1 bgcolor=#FFFFFF><tr>
